  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, and transformer aggregation with weighted fusion achieves the highest accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests the same RNA and image encoders with transformer aggregation but uses concat fusion instead. This clarifies whether the fusion method (weighted vs concat) is critical for performance, while leveraging the strong foundation of scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l. It balances exploration of fusion methods with exploitation of proven components."
